  "title": "Прикрыться",
  "prompt": "One defensive bracing gesture. Lower the head behind the heavy brow and compact the hump. Lift the free forearm slowly from the ground to shield the side of the face, claws curled inward, while tucking the club close against the belly without swinging. Hold a low compact protective silhouette, then lower the free palm back onto the original spot and relax to the exact original crouch. No strike, weapon wind-up, push, lunge, contact, projectile or magic effect. Keep both short feet planted at the same spot and the spine deeply hunched, never stand taller or turn around. Preserve the small body size, simple pixel clusters and torn clothing. Fixed camera and scale, transparent background, whole figure and club within the canvas with empty edge margins.",
